del catches your hair. Find a clinic to book a scalp replacement surgery.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Periodically searches for nearby Balloons, Powerful Balloons or allied units and attacks them for some time while absorbing certain SP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":250,"def":200,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"powerful_balloon":{"slug":"powerful_balloon","name":"Powerful Balloon","icon":"/enemies-icons/Powerful Balloon.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"One of many powerful hot-air balloons that comprise the first levitating plate on Terra.\nTurn the technological legacy of the Ring Lab into children's toys, and balloons for children into a levitating plate's source of power. That is the Columbian way.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter","Grants 1 Buoyancy when on a Levitatable Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"skybuster_soda_sour_and_spicy":{"slug":"skybuster_soda_sour_and_spicy","name":"Skybuster Soda (Sour and Spicy)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skybuster Soda (Sour and Spicy).webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Shake the bottle vigorously for three hundred seconds then pry the cap open according to the instructions, and it will shoot into the sky with immense force. Don't worry, the bottle is made of high-toughness acrylic that will not break easily.\nThe soda inside is a strong sour and spicy flavor. Do not open indoors.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":400,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"flying_toaster_with_jam":{"slug":"flying_toaster_with_jam","name":"Flying Toaster (With Jam)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Flying Toaster (With Jam).webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A crisp beep, then fresh toast spread with jam falls directly onto your plate.\nRestaurants that use it typically require customers to take off their hats. Not for good manners, but because it often mistakes hats for plates.","abilities":["Flying unit.","When not blocked, continuously deals splash damage to surrounding allied units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":400,"def":300,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"skybreaker_soda_keg_family_size":{"slug":"skybreaker_soda_keg_family_size","name":"Skybreaker Soda Keg (Family Size)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skybreaker Soda Keg (Family Size).webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A family-size version of the flying soda keg compresses the soda further, making it so dangerous that it was banned by the ATAO just three days after release. It packs an even bigger punch.\nPerhaps a skull with a hole in it will one day be displayed in the Columbian Aerospace Museum, commemorating the wrong turns in the development of flight technology.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time; the first attack after being blocked deals bonus damage based on Movement Speed, and blows away Balloons and Powerful Balloons at the target's tile"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":650,"def":400,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageR